OL,3,GNEWSALandlord's heartbreak as pub shuts
OL,4,Adown
OL,5,
OL,6,FA publican has revealed his anguish at
OL,7,Fhaving to close down, saying he has
OL,8,Fbeen "crippled" by rising costs and a
OL,9,Fdecline in customer drinking habits.
OL,11,FJon Dean, who ran The Alma Tavern in
OL,12,FWorcester for the last seven years
OL,13,Fbefore closing its doors this week, has
OL,14,Furged the government to consider new
OL,15,Ftax cuts for hospitality venues or face
OL,16,Fmore pubs going under.
OL,18,FHe said: "We employed 14 or 15 people
OL,19,Fhere but we've had to let everyone go.
OL,20,FIt's a bitter pill to swallow."
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
