OL,3,GNEWSALandlord's heartbreak as pub shuts
OL,4,Adown
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Treasury said
OL,7,Fpubs "were already benefitting from a
OL,8,F20% cut in business rates", with Prime
OL,9,FMinister Andy Burnham previously
OL,10,Fcalling it "the first step" to help the
OL,11,Findustry.
